		<APPLET
		   BUSINESS_COMPONENT="VF Com Financial Profile"
		   CLASS="CSSFrame"
		   COMMENTS="KRISHNAKUMAR 11/12/2025:SSJ order Fulfillment-Cloned
Pallavi - Removed special chars from applet name for toggle applet fix IP18 – 15/02/2019
VF: Roseline 15/09/2014 - changed the HTML Height for field &apos;legal disclaimer&apos; -Defect# 2643

MURALIDHARANK 12/05/2014: Created for Postpay TBUI"
		   DISABLE_DATALOSS_WARNING="N"
		   HEIGHT="3"
		   INACTIVE="N"
		   NAME="VF Credit Check Legal Disclaimer Applet TBUI - SSJ Exist Customer"
		   NO_DELETE="Y"
		   NO_INSERT="N"
		   NO_MERGE="N"
		   NO_UPDATE="N"
